      "description": "One satin key in its own slot, its name engraved on it. Wide (96px) for Sign out.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-lkey\"><span>Rotate</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-lkey{width:81px;height:31px;border:0;border-radius:5px;background:linear-gradient(#ecebe7,#cfcec9);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.35),inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,.7);cursor:pointer}.ds-lkey>span{font-family:\"Hanken Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.15em;color:var(--pk-fill,#191918);text-shadow:var(--pk-engr-shadow);display:inline-block}.ds-lkey:active{background:linear-gradient(#d6d5d0,#c6c5c0);box-shadow:inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}.ds-lkey:active>span{transform:translateY(1.2px)}.ds-lkey:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--pk-focus,#161616);outline-offset:3px}"
    },
    {
